 			<p>“How well you draw!” he said, with genuine surprise and pleasure at her skill, adding, with a half-laugh⁠—</p>
 			<p>“Yes, that’s me.”</p>
 			<p>“As you are: this is as you were;” and Amy laid another sketch beside the one he held.</p>
